5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Hi everyone! I'm Sakura! This game sounds like a big mystery, and I love mysteries! Let's all be super honest, okay? Or maybe not! Teehee!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minako,,"Let's keep a level head. To find the werewolf and the possessed, we should observe how everyone's logic evolves over the next few days.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree with Minako. Emotional outbursts can be misleading. I will be focusing on the consistency of your statements and any contradictions that may arise.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I don't care about all that fancy logic! I'll just trust my gut. If someone feels like a liar, I'm calling them out!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I'll just listen for now. It's better to observe everyone's baseline behavior before jumping to conclusions.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Takumi, your gut is so funny! What if your gut is just hungry? Maybe the werewolf is actually a hungry wolf! Chomp chomp!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minako,,"@Sakura, please try to stay focused. @Takumi, while intuition has its place, we need a systematic way to verify information to avoid executing an innocent villager.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"Exactly. If we rely solely on ""feelings,"" the werewolf can easily manipulate the group by mimicking a ""gut feeling"" about someone else.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"Stop talking down to me! I can tell who's acting weird. I'm not gonna let some wolf trick us just because you want to be ""systematic.""","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Misaki,,Let's not argue already. It only creates noise that the werewolf can use to hide.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Noise is fun! But maybe we should play a game? If you're a human, tell us your favorite color! Maybe the wolf forgets how to like colors!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minako,,That won't provide any useful data. We should instead establish a pattern of how we answer questions. Direct answers are easier to track for contradictions.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Victoria,,I second that. I'll be noting who avoids direct questions or changes their narrative. That's usually where the cracks appear.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"Whatever. I'll just follow whoever seems the most sure of themselves. Right now, Minako seems like she knows what she's doing.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Misaki,,I agree with Minako's approach. Directness makes it easier to spot lies.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Sakura,,Boring! You guys are too serious! I'm just gonna be myself and see who gets suspicious of me first. That'll be a real mystery!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Minako,,Very well. We have a basic agreement on observing logic and directness. Let's see what the first night reveals.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
