25,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm ready. Just don't try to trick me, or you'll have to deal with me!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,0,4,talk,Misaki,,I'm looking forward to seeing how things unfold.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
