33,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Good morning! Did anyone have any spooky dreams? I dreamed I was eating a giant cake! Does that make me a wolf?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Minako,,I have some information. I've confirmed that Takumi is human. This narrows down our search for the werewolf.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Minako, you're claiming to be the Seer. If that's true, we now know Takumi is not the werewolf, though he could still be the possessed.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"See! I told you I was good! Minako, thanks for having my back. I trust you completely now.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"That's a very bold claim to make so early, Minako. Are you sure you want to reveal your role immediately?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, a Seer! That's so cool! @Minako, can you see if I'm a little angel or a naughty wolf? Tell us, tell us!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Minako,,"Revealing my role early is a risk, but it provides a focal point for the village. If I were the werewolf, claiming the Seer role now would be a dangerous gamble.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
