42,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, don't be too hasty. We should consider if Minako is trying to gain your trust specifically to divert attention later.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Sakura,,@Takumi is getting all grumpy again! Maybe he's just grumpy because he's not the one with the magic eyes!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Misaki, your caution is valid. However, look at the reactions. Takumi's trust is natural, but the werewolf would likely try to cast doubt on the Seer's findings.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Minako, if you are the Seer, who did you divine last night? You said Takumi is human. Is there any ambiguity in that result?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"Stop grilling her! I'm telling you, Minako is the real deal. I can feel it. I'm voting for whoever keeps trying to confuse us.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'm not trying to confuse anyone. I'm just wondering why the Seer felt the need to be so public so quickly. It feels a bit forced.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Sakura,,Maybe the Seer is just excited! I'm excited too! I think we should vote for the person who talks the most... that's probably Victoria!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Minako,,"@Misaki, the urgency is to establish a trusted core before the werewolf can kill the Seer. Based on the current flow, Misaki's skepticism is becoming a shield.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
