51,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Exactly! Misaki is the one acting weird. I'm with Minako on this. Let's get rid of the one who's doubting the truth!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"I'm simply being analytical. If we execute based on ""vibes"" and ""patterns"" without proof, we're doing the werewolf's work for them.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
